{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-09_end",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-09",
  "title": "Shadows of Days Past",
  "storyCode": "10-10",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "043e7cedefaa59cbdba85b845602c199400483ea1d847f78fc0c835ddfff5609",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Didn't think I would ever see you surprised like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I gave you a hint, after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That rock? Very funny."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I thought..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who did you think would come? Manfred?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm thinking Theresis must be getting senile if he let you live. You even get to roam around Londinium like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I thought you guys were long dead, since I haven't heard anything from you in ages."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well... you know what they say about assuming? See, you were right. I've become sentimental, almost forgot we're mercs."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your detonator hand slowed down, W."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And your hand isn't trembling this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about those mercenaries you brought from Reunion? Did you really come alone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why would I bring them? So that they could get bought out by the Regent, like you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like you care about them. No wonder I didn't see any familiar faces."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Speak for yourself. I saw lots of old friends in Londinium."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You really like headhunting under my nose, don't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let me guess, Schwab is dead, isn't he? You killed him, didn't you, Hoederer? He knew you longer than he knew me, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did your hand tremble when you killed an old friend? One who carried you on his back for an entire day, dodging dozens of Theresis's killers?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're remembering it wrong. He was gone by the Battle for Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, you've always had a better memory than me for the people we fought with."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've always wanted to ask... does it make you feel better to remember the dead?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't think so. I can see it in your eyes. Your dreams haunt you now more than ever."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've known you for as long as you've known me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're only trying to hide your own feelings when move to provoke me like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ha, like you'd know."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In the old days, you would have thrown out those useless resistance fighters as bait."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If someone told me that W volunteered to be the rear guard, I would have told them to find a funnier joke."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did your time in Chernobog drive you mad, W?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did Talulah burn your brains out, or are you seeing the shadows of the dead?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The mad never admit their madness, right? How do you know I'm the one who's mad?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Schwab's head isn't enough to buy Theresis's trust. What was the price you had to pay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Could it have been her? Don't tell me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't even say it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh? There's a reaction."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We've done all we could."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You were too slow, W."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did I hear that right? Are you looking for an excuse for your screw-ups? Who was it who told me he had a plan for everything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When do you think I lost my eye?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You don't mean that Ines..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, she's dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm not..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mercenaries pay a price for breaching trust. I've paid mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g8_jail"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robben",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We've been lucky, haven't we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robben",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Sarkaz got drawn to the explosions in the south. The ones guarding the interrogation room got taken out by Dublinn."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nothing good comes of relying on luck in battle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ha. Did you think you would have lived this long, if not for lady luck?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Prisoner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_423_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W-Who's she? Did they escape from the interrogation room too? Are they friends?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Enemies."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Aim.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(But hold your fire.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Can't talk without your crossbow raised, soldier? Don't think I didn't know you only got out by following us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You want me to thank you? Then you'd better take a trip with me to the hardest prison in Londinium."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll give you credit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're not like the nobles that seep oil from every pore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're the ones who kneel before anyone to cling to their way of life. Sarkaz or Dublinn... it makes no difference to them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You, though... you just won't give up. You're like flies, getting in my way no matter where I go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's my line."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why you...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*Cough* *cough* Mandragora..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your friend's in pretty bad shape."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Same to those soldiers behind you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like we're both in a hurry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's a shame that I don't have time for you today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Suits me just fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Make way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "By the way, soldier—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You had better not die at the hands of the Sarkaz..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Before I have the chance to impale you with my rock."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robben",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whew... they're gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good. Save your ammo for the Sarkaz."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robben",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you mean...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't you think it's too easy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whoever Dublinn took from the interrogation room, I doubt the Sarkaz would let them go so easily."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Or us, for that matter."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g10_lightinduarea_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you have everyone, Lady Heidi?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heidi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, Amiya. They're all here."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Careful!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let the weakest go first. We'll take care of any pursuing mercenaries."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Feist, can you still fight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hang on tight, Bill. Things could get bumpy."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "More enemies ahead! They must have come in from another entrance!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Target found!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Over here! Get them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey, don't run too fast. Got to keep a pair of eyes in the back of your head when moving."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A few got away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Still not enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Get that caster first. Don't let him cast any Arts on our wounded."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank goodness you are back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We aren't late to the party, are we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Great.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "What luck.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whew... Doctor, you didn't tell me there was only one fighter meeting up with us."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "One is enough.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Morgan",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "You know, Doctor, the more I learn about Rhodes Island, the more mysterious it seems."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Morgan",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "But at the end of the day, the most mysterious one is always you."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "There's more than one.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Morgan",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "You always have a card up your sleeve, don't you?"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Morgan",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "On this point, we're the same."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It looks like the Sarkaz have been drawn over here. But we didn't see many souls on the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The ones holding off the enemies inside... I'm worried about them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm worried about W..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W? The one who made such an impression on all those operators at Chernobog?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Er, yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Rhodes Island really IS filled with talent."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We have a... temporary understanding."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Doctor, I felt something eerie in her gaze when she said she was looking for Lady Heidi."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What did you feel, Amiya?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Isn't she always like that?",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Her emotions can be unusual, but there are times that she doesn't try to hide them. Her eyes don't lie at times like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The last time I saw that look from her was when she was yelling at me for the codes to stop the core city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is she still hiding something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Ask her when she comes back.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "She's W. She'll be back.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright... I trusted her once, I'll trust her again."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huff... huff..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're bleeding a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You've got a few holes in you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You should have hidden another bomb on yourself, like you used to. That way, you'd at least have a chance to take me down with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*Cough*... Hoederer..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How much is my head worth? Enough to buy a small house in Londinium?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sorry, W. The Regent has better things to do than remember the name of a random merc."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ha... did you say that to Ines too? Before she gave her life for your little dream?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Still talking big, eh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What were you expecting? A big laugh and a standing ovation for your dumb shit? No tears on my face, Hoederer. That's not like me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who's the dumb one? You're on the ground, not me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Like I said, I'm just... a little surprised."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So surprised you missed multiple chances to maim me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now that's not like you, W. What made you lose your cool?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's see... how about an old friend coming back from the dead and trying to put his sword through me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can believe that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W... who is this old friend you're talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's what I don't like about you... You always think you can see right through me, same as her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Too bad for you, I'm right again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's been a while since you snuck into Londinium. There aren't too many distractions like this in here. What did you see in the city?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're the one following Theresis, not me. Have you not kowtowed to his traitor throne enough times? Still can't see through his tricks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So you knew."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Stop playing this game of you-know I-know. Look like a mercenary for once, Hoederer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can't let you leave here alive, W."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of all the old friends that I've killed... you're probably the one who could best understand the choice I'm making."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now who's indecisive?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm not taking my eyes off you. I want to see the Sarkaz who had the nerve to put his sword through me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Goodbye, W."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Something deflected my sword... a dagger? Where did it come from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't move."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's been a long time, Ascalon."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ascalon",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Same to you. Don't move."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*Cough* Or what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait, you came to save me, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ascalon",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't tell me you came to help him? Don't you know what Theresis did to her—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe work on your aim? I just barely dodged that, what with my injuries and all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ascalon",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Too bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You know you can't kill me now, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You've been my boss, and I've been yours. But there's someone here who's been boss to both of us. And she's clearly not in a good mood."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know. Our heads could drop off our shoulders at any moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I have nothing else to say."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ascalon",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...W."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ascalon",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Each word will make you bleed a little faster."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know, thanks for the concern."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like you'll have to accept a little failure if you don't want to die here together, 'Captain' Hoederer."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
